, \"总飞行里程发送失败：mqtt 未连接\");\r\n            }\r\n        } catch (Exception e) {\r\n            LogUtil.log(TAG, \"总飞行里程发送异常：mqtt 未连接\");\r\n            throw new RuntimeException(e);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n
